{
 "_comment": "CTF flags per Test-games/<slug> (sqc/17-ctf.md): five basic objectives per game plus up to one more per GB of game data, each a concrete asset a reverse engineer wants. A flag passes when one plain extraction leaves at least `min` files matching `glob` (relative to the workspace, ** allowed), or when the run's warnings contain `warning` (\\\"\\\" = no warning at all), or, with `analyze` (a target key from `viwo analyze --list`, optional `slot`), when that analysis leaves the files under `.analysis/`. The library games (pass-*) carry three shared baselines (run record, provenance, the executable collected) and then only objectives specific to that game. `subset` lists the files tools/games_pass.ps1 copies for a game too large to copy whole (the flags then describe that subset).",
 "DDLC-1.1.1-pc": {
  "title": "Doki Doki Literature Club (Ren'Py, 0.3 GB)",
